  "limits": [
    "Actual parent APIs use a cfg-test constructor around an ordinary exact Child/pidfd and private pipes; no normal root/provisioning constructor",
    "All worker PID100/wait/ECHILD/EOF/candidate/populated facts and the outcome event are authored synthetic records",
    "Actual Attempt whole-owner extraction, Terminal output backpressure/EINTR/error, original PAM/cgroup/helper and effective retained faillock are not executed by this selection",
